msgstr "Respuesta:"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid "<h2>Directory listing cache</h2>"
msgstr "<h2>Caché de listados de directorios</h2>"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:36
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose how folders you have already visited are opened in Dolphin."
msgstr "Elija cómo se abren en Dolphin las carpetas que ya ha visitado."

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Use recent listings (recommended)"
msgstr "Usar listados recientes (recomendado)"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Always check the remote"
msgstr "Comprobar siempre el remoto"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid "When opening a folder:"
msgstr "Al abrir una carpeta:"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid "Reuse a listing for:"
msgstr "Reutilizar un listado durante:"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Clear saved listings when saving"
msgstr "Borrar los listados guardados al guardar"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:66
#, kde-format
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Guardar"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:69
#, kde-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancelar"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:77
#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid " second"
msgid_plural " seconds"
msgstr[0] " segundo"
msgstr[1] " segundos"

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Recently visited folders can open faster. File-changing actions still check "
"the remote."
msgstr ""
"Las carpetas visitadas recientemente pueden abrirse más rápido. Las acciones "
"que cambian archivos siguen comprobando el remoto."

#: app/directorylistingsettingsdialog.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid "Every directory opening checks rclone and the remote provider."
msgstr "Cada apertura de directorio consulta rclone y el proveedor remoto."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:105
#, kde-format
msgid "Google Drive"
msgstr "Google Drive"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:106
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"rclone opens a browser window to authorize with Google. This application "
"never receives or displays your OAuth token."
msgstr ""
"rclone abre una ventana del navegador para autorizar con Google. Esta "
"aplicación nunca recibe ni muestra su token de OAuth."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid "OneDrive"
msgstr "OneDrive"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"rclone opens a browser window to authorize with Microsoft, then you will be "
"asked which drive to use."
msgstr ""
"rclone abre una ventana del navegador para autorizar con Microsoft y después "
"se le preguntará qué unidad usar."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgid "Dropbox"
msgstr "Dropbox"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"rclone opens a browser window to authorize with Dropbox. This application "
"never receives or displays your OAuth token."
msgstr ""
"rclone abre una ventana del navegador para autorizar con Dropbox. Esta "
"aplicación nunca recibe ni muestra su token de OAuth."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:114
#, kde-format
msgid "Other Providers…"
msgstr "Otros proveedores…"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:115
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Opens a terminal running rclone's own configuration wizard, for any backend "
"not listed above (S3, WebDAV, SFTP, and more)."
msgstr ""
"Abre un terminal con el asistente de configuración propio de rclone, para "
"cualquier motor no listado arriba (S3, WebDAV, SFTP y más)."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:138 app/configwindow.cpp:139 app/configwindow.cpp:140
#, kde-format
msgid "Creation instructions"
msgstr "Instrucciones de creación"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:157
#, kde-format
msgid "<h2>Cloud storage in Dolphin</h2>"
msgstr "<h2>Almacenamiento en la nube en Dolphin</h2>"

#: app/configwindow.cpp:160
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Connect a cloud provider to browse it in Dolphin under <b>rclone:/</b>. Your "
"configured remotes appear in the list below."
msgstr ""
"Conecte un proveedor de nube para explorarlo en Dolphin en <b>rclone:/</b>. "
"Sus remotos configurados aparecen en la lista de abajo."

#: app/configwindow.cpp:178
#, kde-format
